{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40688","headline":"送龙州田使君旧诗家 · 李洞","name":"送龙州田使君旧诗家","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"御札轸西陲，龙州出牧时。\n度关云作雪，挂栈水成澌。\n劒淬号猿岸，弓悬宿鹤枝。\n江灯混星斗，山木乱枪旗。\n锁库休秤药，开楼又见诗。\n无心陪宴集，吟苦忆京师。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40688.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40688","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}